# **Web DApp Environment Variables**

NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_ENDPOINT=https://api.devnet.solana.com   # Solana RPC endpoint for the dApp (defaults to Devnet cluster):contentReference[oaicite:34]{index=34}

#NEXT_PUBLIC_PROGRAM_ID=YourProgramPublicKeyHere         # (Optional) Public key of the Solana program this dApp interacts with (if applicable)
#APP_ID=my-dapp                                         # (Optional) Application identifier, if used for routing or base path
#APP_BASE_PATH=/dapp/my-dapp                             # (Optional) Base path where the app is served (if using a reverse proxy path)
